1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:02,510
(Sheldon:)This has nothing to do with religion.

2
00:00:02,678 --> 00:00:05,138
(Sheldon:)This has to do with the fact
that you're a tiny man...

3
00:00:05,306 --> 00:00:07,346
(Sheldon:)...who still lives with his mother.

4
00:00:08,309 --> 00:00:11,559
- Sheldon, you are really being unreasonable.
- Am I?

5
00:00:12,021 --> 00:00:15,821
(Sheldon:)Here. Eat this cheese without farting,
and you can sleep with my sister.

6
00:00:17,443 --> 00:00:18,983
MISSY:
Oh, really?

7
00:00:23,032 --> 00:00:24,572
(Sheldon:)Oops.

8
00:00:25,743 --> 00:00:28,583
(Missy:)Shelly, can I speak to you for a minute?
Alone.

9
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:32,079
(Sheldon:)Why does everyone
suddenly wanna talk to me alone?

10
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,250
(Sheldon:)Usually nobody wants
to be alone with me.

11
00:00:40,967 --> 00:00:43,467
(Leonard:)We all make mistakes. Let's move on.

12
00:00:45,137 --> 00:00:46,557
(Missy:)Okay.

13
00:00:46,722 --> 00:00:50,312
I'm not even gonna ask
why you're pimping me out for cheese...

14
00:00:51,143 --> 00:00:54,393
(Missy:)...but since when do you care at all
about who I sleep with?

15
00:00:54,564 --> 00:00:56,734
(Sheldon:)Truthfully,
I've never given it any thought...

16
00:00:56,899 --> 00:01:00,439
(Sheldon:)...but it has been pointed out to me
that you carry DNA of great potential.

